=== technical_detail ===
I configured our Google Play Developer account from scratch. 

This involved navigating store declaration policies, completing data privacy assessments, and satisfying compliance acts to ensure the app met legal store requirements. 

On the technical side, I managed our project settings, target API levels, and versioning structures within Unity. 

Instead of standard APKs, I handled building and publishing our compiled Android App Bundles (.aab files) to upload to the playstore!
